'''HAPPI''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be obtained when beating any stage in [[Kaohsiung Rapid Transit Collaboration Event#Kaohsiung Rapid Transit Red Line|Kaohsiung Rapid Transit Red Line]]. It was added in [[Version 8.7 Update#Update 8.7.5|Version 8.7.5]]. [[True Form]] gives it the ability to target [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] enemies.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 492
|rarity = RR
|name1 = HAPPI
|name2 = HAPPI & Maji Cat
|name3 = HAPPI & Maji Cat & Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''HAPPI & Maji Cat''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''HAPPI & Maji Cat & Cat''' when obtained from any stage in [[Kaohsiung Rapid Transit Orange Line]].

==Strategy/Usage==
HAPPI is a unit built to rush into the frontlines and deal damage, not dissimilar to that of [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Express Cat]]'s. However, when compared to Express Cat it underperforms on nearly every level. HAPPI's only in-battle advantages are a negligible range increase and a crowd-control ability, which is practically useless due to its long attack cycle and relatively long recharge time. Compare this to Express having double the speed, five times the damage and superior ability even in its weakest form. HAPPI's only saving grace is that it is a Rare Cat, allowing it to be used in 4-crown stages.

{{Job|Classification = Rusher & Crowd-Controller}}

